    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc23601a426bf403099e6791",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "被劲敌们投以热切的视线――\n勇敢之心，心满意足地笑了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "91aead69ee86f227f9389cacb9c567ceafbc59120f16d3ce12a8b021544398b3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1112/storytimeline_501112113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        78,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/78/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a80eb00313a80781f90b7f65",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "旁边的西沙里奥据说是位聪慧温柔的姑娘。\n然而，与那柔和气场截然相反、\n她有着碾压级的犀利末脚。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e2a7a9be44bda02d83f37fe0b99482688b5c261c6f6ba787a3511e0d18b4d65",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1112/storytimeline_501112113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        8,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/8/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12684b68383210715155cca0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她们是今年出道的同期。\n话虽如此，感觉与勇心平时朋友们的\n氛围有些不一样――",
      "source_fingerprint": "363a8dea5c1ebc408fec6df682cfe3bded4d48f59b87331a6beaf934e7452e46",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1112/storytimeline_501112113.json",
      "json_path": [
